  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical advisory services - Gender Equality (Global) 2018 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports the integration of gender equality across DFAT&#x2019;s Official Development Assistance (ODA) programming. The Support Unit for Gender Equality (SURGE) provides gender technical advisory services across DFAT to improve the effectiveness of Australia&#x2019;s development program. Internal DFAT staff specialists also provide gender equality technical assistance to improve DFAT&#x2019;s performance on gender equality in development and humanitarian action. This investment is an enabler to implement the International Development Policy and related strategies to strengthen gender equality in Australia&apos;s aid program.</narrative>
  </description>
